1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:05,514
We are Team Lumos, from Dhaka. Satellites say fires jumped in 2012. Did they?

2
00:00:05,864 --> 00:00:09,847
Parallax Fire. Same fires, two cameras, one honest record.

3
00:00:10,197 --> 00:00:14,062
We put NASA’s MODIS and VIIRS fire detections on one fair scale:

4
00:00:14,261 --> 00:00:18,857
a burning calendar, a real map and a live view, with every estimate labelled.

5
00:00:19,207 --> 00:00:23,084
Next: more regions, newer satellites and a Bangla interface,

6
00:00:23,284 --> 00:00:25,941
so anyone can tell a new fire from a new camera.
